[{"id":"sara-12-109-12","words":["verb:sara"],"options":[{"bs":"putuju","en":"they travel"},{"bs":"i krenut će","en":"and will move"},{"bs":"putujte","en":"travel"},{"bs":"i putovao je","en":"and he/it travelled"}],"ref":"12:109","answerWord":"يَسِيرُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/0f6ac9f07a55147967a4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"We sent not before thee (any messengers) save men whom We inspired from among the folk of the townships - Have they not travelled in the land and seen the nature of the consequence for those who were before them? And verily the abode of the Hereafter, for those who ward off (evil), is best. Have ye then no sense? -","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"putovati, ići","en":"to travel, to walk"},"passage":["وَمَآ","أَرْسَلْنَا","مِن","قَبْلِكَ","إِلَّا","رِجَالًا","نُّوحِىٓ","إِلَيْهِم","مِّنْ","أَهْلِ","ٱلْقُرَىٰٓ","أَفَلَمْ","يَسِيرُوا۟","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","فَيَنظُرُوا۟","كَيْفَ","كَانَ","عَٰقِبَةُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","مِن","قَبْلِهِمْ","وَلَدَارُ","ٱلْءَاخِرَةِ","خَيْرٌ","لِّلَّذِينَ","ٱتَّقَوْا۟","أَفَلَا","تَعْقِلُونَ"],"marked":[12],"facts":{"verb":"سارَ"}},{"id":"sara-27-69-1","words":["verb:sara"],"options":[{"bs":"putujte","en":"travel"},{"bs":"i krenut će","en":"and will move"},{"bs":"i putovao je","en":"and he/it travelled"},{"bs":"putuju","en":"they travel"}],"ref":"27:69","answerWord":"سِيرُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/3321aa05d7a1cc91b99a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say (unto them, O Muhammad): Travel in the land and see the nature of the sequel for the guilty!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"putovati, ići","en":"to travel, to walk"},"passage":["قُلْ","سِيرُوا۟","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","فَٱنظُرُوا۟","كَيْفَ","كَانَ","عَٰقِبَةُ","ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"سارَ"}},{"id":"sara-3-137-5","words":["verb:sara"],"options":[{"bs":"pa putujte!","en":"so (you all) travel!"},{"bs":"i krenut će","en":"and will move"},{"bs":"putuju","en":"they travel"},{"bs":"i putovao je","en":"and he/it travelled"}],"ref":"3:137","answerWord":"فَسِيرُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/74d94336ef037da9a871.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Systems have passed away before you. Do but travel in the land and see the nature of the consequence for those who did deny (the messengers).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"putovati, ići","en":"to travel, to walk"},"passage":["قَدْ","خَلَتْ","مِن","قَبْلِكُمْ","سُنَنٌ","فَسِيرُوا۟","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","فَٱنظُرُوا۟","كَيْفَ","كَانَ","عَٰقِبَةُ","ٱلْمُكَذِّبِينَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"سارَ"}},{"id":"sara-28-29-4","words":["verb:sara"],"options":[{"bs":"i putovao je","en":"and he/it travelled"},{"bs":"pa putujte!","en":"so (you all) travel!"},{"bs":"i krenut će","en":"and will move"},{"bs":"putuju","en":"they travel"}],"ref":"28:29","answerWord":"وَسَارَ","answerSound":"audio/c8a2520acb4395c024df.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Then, when Moses had fulfilled the term, and was travelling with his housefolk, he saw in the distance a fire and said unto his housefolk: Bide ye (here). Lo! I see in the distance a fire; peradventure I shall bring you tidings thence, or a brand from the fire that ye may warm yourselves.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"putovati, ići","en":"to travel, to walk"},"passage":["فَلَمَّا","قَضَىٰ","مُوسَى","ٱلْأَجَلَ","وَسَارَ","بِأَهْلِهِۦٓ","ءَانَسَ","مِن","جَانِبِ","ٱلطُّورِ","نَارًا","قَالَ","لِأَهْلِهِ","ٱمْكُثُوٓا۟","إِنِّىٓ","ءَانَسْتُ","نَارًا","لَّعَلِّىٓ","ءَاتِيكُم","مِّنْهَا","بِخَبَرٍ","أَوْ","جَذْوَةٍ","مِّنَ","ٱلنَّارِ","لَعَلَّكُمْ","تَصْطَلُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"سارَ"}},{"id":"amla-3-178-5","words":["verb:amla"],"options":[{"bs":"dajemo odgodu","en":"we grant respite"},{"bs":"dao sam odgodu","en":"I granted respite"},{"bs":"i dajem vremena","en":"and I grant respite"},{"bs":"i dao je odgodu","en":"and he/it granted respite"}],"ref":"3:178","answerWord":"نُمْلِى","answerSound":"audio/e0048024e574e9088277.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And let not those who disbelieve imagine that the rein We give them bodeth good unto their souls. We only give them rein that they may grow in sinfulness. And theirs will be a shameful doom.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"diktirati; dati odgodu","en":"to dictate; to grant respite"},"passage":["وَلَا","يَحْسَبَنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوٓا۟","أَنَّمَا","نُمْلِى","لَهُمْ","خَيْرٌ","لِّأَنفُسِهِمْ","إِنَّمَا","نُمْلِى","لَهُمْ","لِيَزْدَادُوٓا۟","إِثْمًا","وَلَهُمْ","عَذَابٌ","مُّهِينٌ"],"marked":[5,10],"facts":{"verb":"أَمْلَى"}},{"id":"amla-22-44-4","words":["verb:amla"],"options":[{"bs":"pa sam dao vremena","en":"so I granted respite"},{"bs":"dajemo odgodu","en":"we grant respite"},{"bs":"i dao je odgodu","en":"and he/it granted respite"},{"bs":"i dajem vremena","en":"and I grant respite"}],"ref":"22:44","answerWord":"فَأَمْلَيْتُ","answerSound":"audio/746b5db77f0e0d4f6b24.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(And) the dwellers in Midian. And Moses was denied; but I indulged the disbelievers a long while, then I seized them, and how (terrible) was My abhorrence!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"diktirati; dati odgodu","en":"to dictate; to grant respite"},"passage":["وَأَصْحَٰبُ","مَدْيَنَ","وَكُذِّبَ","مُوسَىٰ","فَأَمْلَيْتُ","لِلْكَٰفِرِينَ","ثُمَّ","أَخَذْتُهُمْ","فَكَيْفَ","كَانَ","نَكِيرِ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"أَمْلَى"}},{"id":"amla-22-48-3","words":["verb:amla"],"options":[{"bs":"dao sam odgodu","en":"I granted respite"},{"bs":"i dajem vremena","en":"and I grant respite"},{"bs":"i dao je odgodu","en":"and he/it granted respite"},{"bs":"dajemo odgodu","en":"we grant respite"}],"ref":"22:48","answerWord":"أَمْلَيْتُ","answerSound":"audio/116dace0f6eb3876583c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And how many a township did I suffer long though it was sinful! Then I grasped it. Unto Me is the return.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"diktirati; dati odgodu","en":"to dictate; to grant respite"},"passage":["وَكَأَيِّن","مِّن","قَرْيَةٍ","أَمْلَيْتُ","لَهَا","وَهِىَ","ظَالِمَةٌ","ثُمَّ","أَخَذْتُهَا","وَإِلَىَّ","ٱلْمَصِيرُ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"أَمْلَى"}},{"id":"amla-47-25-14","words":["verb:amla"],"options":[{"bs":"i dao je odgodu","en":"and he/it granted respite"},{"bs":"pa sam dao vremena","en":"so I granted respite"},{"bs":"i dajem vremena","en":"and I grant respite"},{"bs":"dajemo odgodu","en":"we grant respite"}],"ref":"47:25","answerWord":"وَأَمْلَىٰ","answerSound":"audio/64cc939cb232f66e086c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! those who turn back after the guidance hath been manifested unto them, Satan hath seduced them, and He giveth them the rein.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"diktirati; dati odgodu","en":"to dictate; to grant respite"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ٱرْتَدُّوا۟","عَلَىٰٓ","أَدْبَٰرِهِم","مِّنۢ","بَعْدِ","مَا","تَبَيَّنَ","لَهُمُ","ٱلْهُدَى","ٱلشَّيْطَٰنُ","سَوَّلَ","لَهُمْ","وَأَمْلَىٰ","لَهُمْ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"أَمْلَى"}},{"id":"bayaa-48-10-2","words":["verb:bayaa"],"options":[{"bs":"daju ti prisegu vjernosti","en":"they pledge allegiance to you"},{"bs":"pa im daj prisegu vjernosti!","en":"so pledge allegiance to them!"},{"bs":"sklopili ste pogodbu","en":"you (all) made a bargain"},{"bs":"daju prisegu vjernosti","en":"they pledge allegiance"}],"ref":"48:10","answerWord":"يُبَايِعُونَكَ","answerSound":"audio/60f1d58b8ad21aa96cde.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! those who swear allegiance unto thee (Muhammad), swear allegiance only unto Allah. The Hand of Allah is above their hands. So whosoever breaketh his oath, breaketh it only to his soul's hurt; while whosoever keepeth his covenant with Allah, on him will He bestow immense reward.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dati prisegu vjernosti","en":"to pledge allegiance"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","يُبَايِعُونَكَ","إِنَّمَا","يُبَايِعُونَ","ٱللَّهَ","يَدُ","ٱللَّهِ","فَوْقَ","أَيْدِيهِمْ","فَمَن","نَّكَثَ","فَإِنَّمَا","يَنكُثُ","عَلَىٰ","نَفْسِهِۦ","وَمَنْ","أَوْفَىٰ","بِمَا","عَٰهَدَ","عَلَيْهُ","ٱللَّهَ","فَسَيُؤْتِيهِ","أَجْرًا","عَظِيمًا"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"بَايَعَ"}},{"id":"bayaa-48-10-4","words":["verb:bayaa"],"options":[{"bs":"daju prisegu vjernosti","en":"they pledge allegiance"},{"bs":"sklopili ste pogodbu","en":"you (all) made a bargain"},{"bs":"daju ti prisegu vjernosti","en":"they pledge allegiance to you"},{"bs":"pa im daj prisegu vjernosti!","en":"so pledge allegiance to them!"}],"ref":"48:10","answerWord":"يُبَايِعُونَ","answerSound":"audio/03d382cfdbb009d88e00.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! those who swear allegiance unto thee (Muhammad), swear allegiance only unto Allah. The Hand of Allah is above their hands. So whosoever breaketh his oath, breaketh it only to his soul's hurt; while whosoever keepeth his covenant with Allah, on him will He bestow immense reward.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dati prisegu vjernosti","en":"to pledge allegiance"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","يُبَايِعُونَكَ","إِنَّمَا","يُبَايِعُونَ","ٱللَّهَ","يَدُ","ٱللَّهِ","فَوْقَ","أَيْدِيهِمْ","فَمَن","نَّكَثَ","فَإِنَّمَا","يَنكُثُ","عَلَىٰ","نَفْسِهِۦ","وَمَنْ","أَوْفَىٰ","بِمَا","عَٰهَدَ","عَلَيْهُ","ٱللَّهَ","فَسَيُؤْتِيهِ","أَجْرًا","عَظِيمًا"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"بَايَعَ"}}]